  "body": "On a private homeserver without any public rooms, Synapse 0.26.0 throws this exception from time to time:\r\n```\r\nsynapse.http.server - 145 - ERROR - POST-286- Failed handle request synapse.http.server._async_render on <synapse.rest.ClientRestResource object at 0x7fd0c5b61750>: <XForwardedForRequest at 0x7fd0b4b62f80 method=POST uri=/_matrix/client/r0/publicRooms?access_token=<redacted> clientproto=HTTP/1.0 site=8008>: Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/rest/client/v1/room.py\", line 360, in on_POST\r\n    network_tuple=network_tuple,\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/handlers/room_list.py\", line 86, in get_local_public_room_list\r\n    limit, since_token, network_tuple=network_tuple\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/util/logcontext.py\", line 278, in g\r\n    res = f(*args, **kwargs)\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py\", line 1532, in unwindGenerator\r\n    return _inlineCallbacks(None, gen, Deferred())\r\n--- <exception caught here> ---\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py\", line 1386, in _inlineCallbacks\r\n    result = g.send(result)\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/handlers/room_list.py\", line 209, in _get_public_room_list\r\n    for i in xrange(0, len(rooms_to_scan), step):\r\nexceptions.ValueError: xrange() arg 3 must not be zero\r\n```\r\nIt looks like this was introduced by commit 44a1bfd6a6a1cda272677c9ea8704957bc940509.",
